00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:49.960
ROUVEN: Ja.

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:51.200
MURAT: Ja. Was stimmt nicht mit dir?

00:13:51.920 --> 00:13:52.640
ROUVEN: Die besten Gene gekriegt.

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:52.880
MURAT: Ja?

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:53.120
ROUVEN: Ja.

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:54.320
MURAT: Die besten Gene gekriegt? Okay.

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:56.000
GÜNI: Du? Oh!

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:56.440
MURAT: Bei dir ist...

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:57.200
GÜNI: Oh.

00:13:57.200 --> 00:13:57.800
MURAT: Du bist doch hier...

00:13:58.040 --> 00:13:59.520
GÜNI: Armes Tiger Tatti Tatti.

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:00.480
